chunks.text:
Disciplinary sanctions will be imposed by a reasoned decision of the Council, after hearing from the accused.

They are:

(a) the warning;

(b) censorship;

(c) suspension from the exercise of the profession for a period of time not less than two months and not more than one year;

(d) removal from the register.40

